  {
   "bundle": "org/netbeans/modules/uihandler/Bundle.properties",
   "key": "LBL_BottomText1",
   "en": "<html>Help us improve the MyApplication by providing anonymous usage data.</html>",
   "zh": "<html>通过提供匿名使用数据，帮助我们改进 MyApplication。</html>"
  },
  {
   "bundle": "org/netbeans/modules/uihandler/Bundle.properties",
   "key": "LBL_BottomText2",
   "en": "<html>If you agree to participate, the application will send anonymous \\ information about the high-level features that you use to a database at myapplication.org.</html>",
   "zh": "<html>如果您同意参与，应用程序会将您所使用的高层功能的匿名 \\ 信息发送到 myapplication.org 上的数据库。</html>"
  },
  {
   "bundle": "org/netbeans/modules/uihandler/Bundle.properties",
   "key": "LBL_BottomText3",
   "en": "<html>The usage statistics help us better understand user \\ requirements and prioritize improvements in future releases. We will never \\ reverse-engineer the collected data to find specific details about your projects.</html>",
   "zh": "<html>使用统计有助于我们更好地了解用户 \\ 需求，并在未来版本中优先安排改进。我们绝不会 \\ 对收集的数据进行逆向分析以获取有关您项目的具体细节。</html>"
  },
